@startuml
!include ../../theme.puml
title AgentRun 状态机（V3）

[*] --> ACCEPTED : RunCommandPort.submit\n持久化 RunAccepted
ACCEPTED --> QUEUED : RunScheduler.enqueue
QUEUED --> RUNNING : 签发 RuntimeLease\n创建 AgentRunAttempt
RUNNING --> WAITING_PERMISSION : PermissionDecision.ASK
WAITING_PERMISSION --> RUNNING : 审批通过且 Permit 有效
WAITING_PERMISSION --> FAILED : 拒绝 / 超时 / 执行约束失效
RUNNING --> WAITING_CHILDREN : 结构化委派
WAITING_CHILDREN --> RUNNING : Join / 受控移交完成
RUNNING --> COMPLETED : 最终输出已提交
RUNNING --> FAILED : 不可恢复故障
RUNNING --> CANCELING : cancel
WAITING_PERMISSION --> CANCELING : cancel
WAITING_CHILDREN --> CANCELING : cancel
CANCELING --> CANCELED : 子 Run 收敛 + Runtime 中断
RUNNING --> RECOVERING : Lease 丢失 / Worker 崩溃
RECOVERING --> QUEUED : 安全恢复检查通过\n新 Attempt
RECOVERING --> FAILED : 未知副作用或无安全恢复点

COMPLETED --> [*]
FAILED --> [*]
CANCELED --> [*]

note right of WAITING_CHILDREN
  父 Run 终态前，所有 Child Run 必须
  Join、Cancel 或完成受控移交，不允许孤儿 Run。
end note
@enduml
